{"display_label": "Fictional calendar 166035", "reference": "REF-166035", "title": "Original 166035"}

So the reference is "REF-166035". Therefore, the new title should be "Review REF-166035".

Putting it all together, I'll first read the record to get the reference, then update the title. So the actions should be in order: read, update, done.

I think that should fix the malformed action error because each action is a separate JSON object, and the structure is correct. I'll make sure to only include one action per JSON object as per the user's instructions.
